          "en-US": "Kith"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Your people — a local-first, p2p address book on Loam"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Kith is the contacts app of the Loam ecosystem: a local-first, peer-to-peer address book. A contact can carry a Loam identity, turning it into a grantable principal for other apps (Scala editors, Qaku admins). Books sync across your devices; import/export vCards."
